    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The oversized “Anomaly without context becomes noise” thesis and BLOCK→ALLOW reversal create a clear narrative hook across all viewports. However, the main artifact remains a conventional dark card plus ranked-list dashboard; repeated rows, cyan badges, monospace labels, and thin borders do not turn precedent memory into a uniquely recognizable visual metaphor. The mobile stack further reduces the idea to generic cards.",
